# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) and fill in a real key to enable the
# transaction-history view. Get a free key at etherscan.io/myapikey (free
# account signup required — see desktop/src/etherscan.ts for why: Etherscan's
# API no longer accepts requests without one).
#
# Read at RUNTIME by dotenvy::dotenv() in this crate's run() (lib.rs) — never
# baked into the compiled binary or the frontend's JS bundle, unlike the
# previous VITE_ETHERSCAN_API_KEY approach this replaces (see
# fetch_etherscan_list's own doc comment for why that mattered).
ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=
